// PPO hyperparameters for the FINAL fine-tune stage that produced
// models/heading_hold/skill_heading_hold_goal2_ultratight_hw15speed7.mpk — see
// heading_hold_ultra_tight_tracking.reward.ron for the full recipe and the earlier stage
// (heading_hold_tight_tracking.{reward,ppo}.ron) this continues from. NOT the task default;
// pass explicitly via --ppo-config. entropy_coef MUST be 0.0 — see
// heading_hold_tight_tracking.ppo.ron's comment, still true here since this continues from
// that BC/PPO-converged policy. lr=1e-5 (3x below heading_hold_tight_tracking.ppo.ron's 3e-5,
// 30x below the task default 3e-4) is what let the reward-scale change (speed_error_scale
// 10->7, heading_error_weight 1.2->1.5) refine the policy without destabilizing it — a
// same-lr/same-reward continuation of the incumbent alone only reached 0.32deg heading with
// altitude/speed regressing slightly; this lr drop paired with the reward change is what
// closed the rest of the gap to 0.15deg while also improving altitude/speed.
(
    gamma: 0.99,
    gae_lambda: 0.95,
    clip_epsilon: 0.1,
    value_coef: 0.5,
    entropy_coef: 0.0,
    lr: 0.00001,
    rollout_steps: 4096,
    n_epochs: 4,
    minibatch: 64,
    seed: Some(44),
)
